00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:57.220
This was the care that our crew, through props or wardrobe or hair or makeup or set dressing, would take with our show.
这就是我们的剧组——无论是通过道具、服装、发型、化妆还是布景——对我们这部剧所投入的心思。

16
00:00:57.220 --> 00:01:00.320
And I love when people notice and connect the dots.
我特别喜欢人们注意到并把这些线索串联起来。

17
00:01:00.820 --> 00:01:02.080
Sarah, such a great observation.
萨拉，观察得太仔细了。

18
00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:06.860
