好吧，我有个关于这方面的小花絮要分享。

880
00:42:01.070 --> 00:42:01.490
Okay.
好的。

881
00:42:01.850 --> 00:42:03.690
But first, let me do some fan questions.
但首先，让我来回答一些粉丝的问题。

882
00:42:04.410 --> 00:42:04.950
Peyton H.
来自佛蒙特州的佩顿·H

883
00:42:05.090 --> 00:42:05.990
from Vermont said,
说：

884
00:42:06.350 --> 00:42:10.030
Jenna, I know there was a stunt double for you in some of your volleyball scenes,
珍娜，我知道你有些排球镜头用了替身演员，

885
00:42:10.050 --> 00:42:14.350
but my question is, how much was you and how much was the stunt double?
但我的问题是，有多少是你自己完成的，又有多少是替身完成的？

886
00:42:14.590 --> 00:42:15.590
And Megan B.
而来自爱达荷州杰罗姆的梅根·B

887
00:42:15.910 --> 00:42:17.530
from Jerome, Idaho said,
说：

888
00:42:17.950 --> 00:42:20.370
Have you played much volleyball in real life?
你在现实生活中打过很多排球吗？

889
00:42:21.130 --> 00:42:21.630
All right.
好的。

890
00:42:21.890 --> 00:42:23.270
I'm going to break down all the volleyball.
我来详细剖析一下所有的排球情节。

891
00:42:23.450 --> 00:42:25.010
I love all these questions, you guys.
我喜欢所有这些问题，伙计们。

892
00:42:25.010 --> 00:42:29.750
I love them because you know I know the answer to some of them, and others I'm intrigued.
我太喜欢了，因为你们知道其中有些答案我知道，而其他的则让我很感兴趣。

893
00:42:30.030 --> 00:42:31.550
I have played a lot of volleyball.
我打过很多排球。

894
00:42:31.850 --> 00:42:32.950
You don't say.
真的吗。

895
00:42:33.230 --> 00:42:34.090
I have.
我打过。

896
00:42:34.650 --> 00:42:35.130
When?
什么时候？

897
00:42:35.610 --> 00:42:37.730
In, like, grade school.
大概在，小学的时候。

898
00:42:37.970 --> 00:42:38.350
Your youth?
你的青少年时期？

899
00:42:38.350 --> 00:42:38.950
High school.
高中。

900
00:42:39.070 --> 00:42:39.350
Okay.
好吧。

901
00:42:39.510 --> 00:42:40.990
My youth at the beach.
我的沙滩青春。

902
00:42:41.190 --> 00:42:46.070
I know how to play volleyball, and I have a really great underhand serve.
我会打排球，而且我的低手发球非常棒。

903
00:42:46.230 --> 00:42:46.970
So do I.
我也是。

904
00:42:47.130 --> 00:42:47.990
Very consistent.
非常稳定。

905
00:42:48.250 --> 00:42:48.370
Yes.
是的。

906
00:42:48.370 --> 00:42:50.310
Nothing fancy, but we'll always get in.
没什么花哨的，但总能发过去。

907
00:42:50.410 --> 00:42:50.770
Same.
一样。

908
00:42:51.170 --> 00:42:52.710
They didn't want that for Pam.
他们不想让帕姆那样。

909
00:42:52.910 --> 00:42:53.970
I offered to do it.
我主动提出要这么做。

910
00:42:54.090 --> 00:42:54.850
They weren't interested.
他们不感兴趣。

911
00:42:55.010 --> 00:42:56.810
They wanted overhand serve.
他们想要高手发球。

912
00:42:57.130 --> 00:43:00.050
Because you know in varsity high school, you have to serve overhand.
因为你知道在高中校队里，你必须用高手发球。

913
00:43:00.190 --> 00:43:01.230
I did not know that.
我不知道这个。

914
00:43:01.230 --> 00:43:02.630
I did not play varsity.
我没进过校队。

915
00:43:02.790 --> 00:43:04.850
I know this because my daughter's playing volleyball.
我知道这个是因为我女儿在打排球。

916
00:43:05.070 --> 00:43:05.710
She is.
是的。

917
00:43:05.750 --> 00:43:10.410
In junior high, she can still do underhand, but they're wanting them already to do overhand.
在初中，她还可以用低手，但他们已经要求她们用高手了。

918
00:43:10.770 --> 00:43:12.030
Well, here was the problem.
好吧，问题出在这儿。

919
00:43:12.030 --> 00:43:14.270
I have a shoulder injury.
我肩膀有伤。

920
00:43:14.570 --> 00:43:17.410
I have tendonitis in my right shoulder, and it's really bad.
我右肩有肌腱炎，而且很严重。

921
00:43:17.550 --> 00:43:20.730
And I have a sort of, like, lack of range of motion.
而且我有点，怎么说呢，活动范围受限。

922
00:43:20.990 --> 00:43:26.030
And doing that overhead swoopy motion, it's even a little sore.
做那个头顶划过的动作，甚至会有点酸痛。

923
00:43:26.030 --> 00:43:26.870
I'm doing it now.
我现在就在做。

924
00:43:27.050 --> 00:43:33.170
It's even a little bit sore if I'm holding nothing in my hand or if I'm not hitting a volleyball.
即使我手里什么都没拿，或者没在打排球，它也还是有点酸痛。

925
00:43:33.990 --> 00:43:34.650
What?
什么？

926
00:43:34.970 --> 00:43:35.950
Why are you laughing?
你笑什么？

927
00:43:36.690 --> 00:43:38.050
Why is it so funny?
有什么好笑的？

928
00:43:39.470 --> 00:43:40.130
What?
什么？

929
00:43:40.910 --> 00:43:41.970
I don't know.
我不知道。

930
00:43:42.170 --> 00:43:45.850
I was just going to say, and alias.
我刚想说，《双面女间谍》。

931
00:43:46.590 --> 00:43:48.090
Oh, my God.
天哪。

932
00:43:49.490 --> 00:43:52.570
You're still tracking why I can't be on alias?
你还在纠结为什么我不能演《双面女间谍》？

933
00:43:52.590 --> 00:43:54.610
I will for the rest of my life.
我一辈子都会纠结。

934
00:43:55.470 --> 00:44:03.410
How can you swing on a rope and, like, do a cartwheel and, like, throw a grenade or whatever she did?
你怎么能在绳子上荡来荡去，然后做侧手翻，还能扔手榴弹或者她做过的那些？

935
00:44:03.710 --> 00:44:05.130
I mean, you're making a good point.
我是说，你说的很有道理。

936
00:44:05.270 --> 00:44:05.970
Okay, go on.
好吧，你继续。

937
00:44:05.990 --> 00:44:06.870
I hadn't thought about that.
我之前没想到这一点。

938
00:44:07.010 --> 00:44:11.170
You know, they didn't ask me in my audition how my overhand range of motion was.
你知道的，他们在我试镜的时候并没有问我高手发球的活动范围怎么样。

939
00:44:11.310 --> 00:44:12.650
Well, that might have rolled it out.
好吧，那可能会直接被淘汰。

940
00:44:12.810 --> 00:44:15.010
They shouldn't have even auditioned me for that role.
他们甚至不该让我去试镜那个角色。

941
00:44:15.110 --> 00:44:17.010
There's no way I could have swung on a rope.
我根本不可能在绳子上荡来荡去。

942
00:44:18.390 --> 00:44:18.990
All right.
好吧。

943
00:44:19.070 --> 00:44:19.570
Well, listen.
听着。

944
00:44:19.970 --> 00:44:21.850
They had to get me a stunt double.
他们必须给我找个替身演员。

945
00:44:22.070 --> 00:44:23.810
Her name was Nancy McCrum.
她叫南希·麦克鲁姆。

946
00:44:24.790 --> 00:44:30.210
And Randy was kind enough to send me her photo, which we'll post in the Office Lady Pod stories.
兰迪很好心地把她的照片发给了我，我们会把它发在《办公室女士》播客快讯里。

947
00:44:30.750 --> 00:44:32.510
And he sent me her resume.
他还把她的简历发给了我。

948
00:44:32.890 --> 00:44:39.730
On her resume, it shows her height and her weight, which I just want to say, I can't believe I used to weigh that.
在她的简历上，写着她的身高和体重，我只想说，我真不敢相信我以前有那么重。

949
00:44:40.050 --> 00:44:43.430
Oh, because they matched her height and weight to you?
哦，因为他们的身高和体重和你是匹配的？

950
00:44:43.510 --> 00:44:43.730
Yes.
是的。

951
00:44:43.730 --> 00:44:48.990
When they find you a body double or a stunt double, they have to match the person's height, the weight, the general hair color,
当他们给你找替身或特技替身时，他们必须匹配这个人的身高、体重、大致的发色，

952
00:44:49.010 --> 00:44:52.130
or they'll put a wig on the person or color that person's hair.
或者他们会给这个人戴上假发或给这个人的头发染色。

953
00:44:52.270 --> 00:44:57.230
But it's more than that because I was on this one movie, and they had to get a body double for me.
但不仅于此，因为我曾拍过一部电影，他们得为我找一个身体替身。

954
00:44:57.670 --> 00:45:00.370
And the woman showed up, and she was my height and weight.
结果那个女人来了，她和我的身高体重一样。

955
00:45:00.390 --> 00:45:04.350
But her, like, weight distribution was totally different from mine.
但她的，比如说，体重分布和我的完全不同。

956
00:45:04.630 --> 00:45:05.950
So walking and…
所以走路的时候……

957
00:45:05.950 --> 00:45:06.870
She didn't look like me.
她看起来不像我。

958
00:45:06.870 --> 00:45:07.550
She didn't look like you.
她看起来不像你。

959
00:45:07.710 --> 00:45:08.790
This happened to me, Jenna.
这事也发生在我身上，珍娜。

960
00:45:09.210 --> 00:45:11.350
I did a movie called Struck by Lightning.
我拍过一部叫《被闪电击中》的电影。

961
00:45:11.630 --> 00:45:18.270
And there was this long tracking dolly scene that started in a room and ended up on the sofa that I was sitting on.
有一个很长的移动轨道镜头，从一个房间开始，最后落在我坐的沙发上。

962
00:45:18.390 --> 00:45:18.570
Okay.
好吧。

963
00:45:19.210 --> 00:45:27.430
And they had a body double for me for all the lighting set up because it was going to take a really long time to get this set up.
为了所有的灯光调试，他们为我找了个替身，因为调试这个要花很长时间。

964
00:45:28.630 --> 00:45:34.590
So after an hour of them setting this all up, using the body double, it's time for me to report on set.
所以在他们用替身调试了一个小时之后，轮到我去片场报到了。

965
00:45:34.750 --> 00:45:37.490
We do this long, intricate tracking shot.
我们拍了这个漫长而复杂的追踪镜头。

966
00:45:37.610 --> 00:45:38.650
The camera's coming down.
摄像机推了过来。

967
00:45:38.830 --> 00:45:43.590
This long track lands on me on the sofa, and it cuts part of my head off.
这个长镜头最后落在我坐的沙发上，结果把我头的一截给拍切掉了。

968
00:45:43.810 --> 00:45:46.870
Well, what they found out was she was my exact height.
后来他们发现，她和我的身高完全一样。

969
00:45:47.070 --> 00:45:52.050
They immediately called for her because the director of photography had set up all this time for the shot.
他们立刻叫她过来，因为摄影指导为这个镜头花了大量时间调试。

970
00:45:52.190 --> 00:45:53.690
And he said, are you 5'1"?
他说，你身高是五尺一寸吗？

971
00:45:53.690 --> 00:45:54.450
And she said, yes.
她说，是的。

972
00:45:54.550 --> 00:45:55.830
And she came and stood next to me.
然后她过来站在我旁边。

973
00:45:55.830 --> 00:45:56.990
We were the same height.
我们身高一样。

974
00:45:57.150 --> 00:45:59.070
And then he said, sit side by side.
然后他说，并排坐着。

975
00:45:59.270 --> 00:46:00.730
We sat side by side.
我们并排坐着。

976
00:46:00.930 --> 00:46:02.950
I had a longer torso than she did.
我的躯干比她长。

977
00:46:03.170 --> 00:46:03.650
Yes!
对吧！

978
00:46:03.970 --> 00:46:05.350
This is what I'm saying.
这就是我要说的。

979
00:46:05.690 --> 00:46:07.890
So they had to, like, measure her.
所以他们不得不，比如，测量她。

980
00:46:07.990 --> 00:46:09.630
Like, did we have the same waist?
比如，我们的腰围一样吗？

981
00:46:09.630 --> 00:46:12.090
The circumference of your thigh.
你大腿的周长。

982
00:46:12.370 --> 00:46:13.470
Like, all of that.
诸如此类的。

983
00:46:13.690 --> 00:46:17.930
And Nancy McCrum was just an exact body double for me.
而南希·麦克鲁姆就是我完美的身体替身。

984
00:46:18.090 --> 00:46:22.070
Well, I could never tell that there was a body double there, so they did a great job.
好吧，我完全看不出那里有个替身，所以他们做得太棒了。

985
00:46:22.190 --> 00:46:23.470
Well, here's what I did.
嗯，我是这么做的。

986
00:46:23.470 --> 00:46:30.050
She was also very good at volleyball, and she taught me how to do the motion, how to jump
她排球也打得很好，她教我怎么做动作，怎么起跳，

987
00:46:30.050 --> 00:46:31.890
up, how to serve it, and all of that.
怎么发球，以及所有这些。

988
00:46:32.030 --> 00:46:37.470
And I did a whole, whole bunch of takes, and we used a CGI ball.
我拍了一大堆镜头，然后我们用了一个CGI球。

989
00:46:37.470 --> 00:46:40.010
So that you didn't have to actually make the contact.
这样你就不必真的去触球了。

990
00:46:40.370 --> 00:46:40.610
Yeah.
是啊。

991
00:46:41.170 --> 00:46:47.210
Randy reminded me that the very first time I tried to do it by making contact with the
兰迪提醒我，我第一次尝试去击球的时候，

992
00:46:47.210 --> 00:46:48.970
ball, and I, like, winced in pain.
我疼得直咧嘴。

993
00:46:48.970 --> 00:46:50.830
And he was like, no, no, no more ball.
然后他说，不，不，再也不要球了。

994
00:46:50.910 --> 00:46:52.070
We're never having her do that again.
我们绝不会让她再做那种事了。

995
00:46:52.070 --> 00:46:54.790
Because like we said, he was so good at taking care of us.
正如我们所说，他太擅长照顾我们了。

996
00:46:55.030 --> 00:46:56.870
He was like, we're going to do a CGI ball.
他说，我们要用一个CGI球。

997
00:46:56.870 --> 00:47:02.830
But he said, while the serving and putting in a fake ball was not difficult, it was really
但他说，虽然发球和放一个假球并不难，但要让演员对着一个假球扑过去却非常困难。

998
00:47:02.830 --> 00:47:07.910
difficult to have people dive for a fake ball.
是的。

999
00:47:08.250 --> 00:47:08.510
Yes.
所以你刚刚给我看的那个视频里扑向地面的那个人，其实是在对着空气扑救。

1000
00:47:08.670 --> 00:47:13.390
So that person that is diving in that video you just showed me is diving at nothing.
所以你刚刚给我看的那个视频里扑向地面的那个人，其实是在对着空气扑救。

1001
00:47:13.570 --> 00:47:14.710
Well, that might-
好吧，那也许——

1002
00:47:14.710 --> 00:47:14.890
That commitment.
那个承诺。

1003
00:47:15.170 --> 00:47:16.710
That might make sense.
那可能说得通。

1004
00:47:16.850 --> 00:47:17.970
A little bit.
有一点。

1005
00:47:17.970 --> 00:47:26.030
But on the DVD commentary, Ken was very complimentary in saying that, Jenna, you did great fakie arm
不过在DVD评论音轨里，肯非常赞赏地说，詹娜，你的假手臂

1006
00:47:26.030 --> 00:47:26.490
motion.
动作做得很好。

1007
00:47:26.790 --> 00:47:27.190
Yeah.
是啊。

1008
00:47:27.310 --> 00:47:31.090
Well, I have to give credit to Nancy because she was such a good teacher.
好吧，我得感谢南希，因为她是个极好的老师。

1009
00:47:31.230 --> 00:47:32.890
We became a little chummy on this episode.
我们在这一集里变得有点要好了。

1010
00:47:33.010 --> 00:47:37.530
And they did shoot with her a little bit from behind with a real ball.
而且他们确实用真球从后面拍摄了她的一些镜头。

1011
00:47:37.910 --> 00:47:42.310
And that was really helpful for the people on the other side because then they were diving
这对另一边的人真的很有帮助，因为当时他们是在为

1012
00:47:42.310 --> 00:47:44.810
for a real ball, and they used some of those shots.
真球扑救，他们也用了一些这样的镜头。

1013
00:47:44.810 --> 00:47:48.250
But I'm not sure if they ever ended up using any of her serves.
但我不知道他们最终有没有用她的发球镜头。

1014
00:47:48.450 --> 00:47:51.790
I think they were mostly my fakie serves that made it in.
我觉得最后播出的基本上都是我假装发球的镜头。

1015
00:47:51.910 --> 00:47:58.090
But I do want to say one more thing, which is that over on officetelly.com, Jenny Tan
但我还想说另一件事，就是在officetelly.com网站上，珍妮·陈

1016
00:47:58.090 --> 00:48:03.510
took a bunch of amazing photos of me serving with no ball.
拍了许多我无球发球的精彩照片。

1017
00:48:03.830 --> 00:48:04.650
Oh, really?
哦，真的吗？

1018
00:48:04.890 --> 00:48:05.830
And they're really cool.
而且真的很酷。

1019
00:48:05.830 --> 00:48:08.910
And I grabbed them so that we can put them up on Office Ladies Pod.
我把它们保存下来了，这样我们就可以发到《办公室女士》播客上了。

1020
00:48:09.270 --> 00:48:14.190
Your story about Nancy, Jenna, just reminded me of an amazing run-in I just had
詹娜，你关于南希的故事让我想起了一次刚刚经历的奇妙偶遇

1021
00:48:14.190 --> 00:48:15.630
four years.
四年了。

1022
00:48:16.050 --> 00:48:20.730
Steve had a body double named Eric, Sulky, and Jenna.
史蒂夫有一个替身叫埃里克、萨尔基和詹娜。

1023
00:48:21.090 --> 00:48:24.430
Josh and I were in the wine country for our anniversary, and I hear Angela, and I turn
我和乔希在酒乡庆祝我们的结婚纪念日，我听到有人叫安吉拉，我转过

1024
00:48:24.430 --> 00:48:27.190
around, and there is Eric and his wife.
身去，结果是埃里克和他的妻子。

1025
00:48:27.430 --> 00:48:27.910
No way!
不会吧！

1026
00:48:27.910 --> 00:48:29.650
He is still working with Steve.
他还在和史蒂夫合作。

1027
00:48:29.830 --> 00:48:32.470
It's been like 16 years they've been working together.
他们一起工作大概有16年了。

1028
00:48:32.990 --> 00:48:35.150
They're working together on a movie right now.
他们现在正一起合作一部电影。

1029
00:48:35.290 --> 00:48:36.010
Look at that.
你看这事。

1030
00:48:36.150 --> 00:48:37.330
Oh, my gosh!
哦，天哪！

1031
00:48:37.530 --> 00:48:39.110
Yes, I remember him.
对，我记得他。

1032
00:48:39.330 --> 00:48:39.710
I know.
我知道。

1033
00:48:39.770 --> 00:48:40.950
He was so lovely.
他太可爱了。

1034
00:48:40.950 --> 00:48:45.490
And I said, Eric, it's so crazy to see you outside of a suit because he was just in casual
我说，埃里克，看到你穿便装而不是西装，感觉太疯狂了，因为他当时正穿着休闲

1035
00:48:45.490 --> 00:48:45.970
clothes.
服装。

