1430
01:05:05.160 --> 01:05:08.920
And she said it was just like the sweetest, most thoughtful thing.
她说这真的是最贴心、最周到的举动。

1431
01:05:09.120 --> 01:05:09.900
And you know what?
你知道吗？

1432
01:05:09.980 --> 01:05:11.780
