And Michael's like, well, he's just thinking about his own gifts.
迈克尔却说，好吧，他只是在盘算自己的圣诞礼物呢。

1467
01:06:53.500 --> 01:06:54.500
Not helping, Michael.
帮倒忙啊，迈克尔。

1468
01:06:55.860 --> 01:06:57.940
