That's right.
没错。

1845
01:24:31.150 --> 01:24:32.990
It was deleted from that.
这些内容都被删掉了。

1846
01:24:33.370 --> 01:24:33.890
Oh my gosh.
哦，天哪。

1847
01:24:33.890 --> 01:24:39.450
And then the final master cut of the whole episode that the network gets to review before
然后，整个剧集最终的母带剪辑版，也就是电视台在播出前要审看的版本，

1848
01:24:39.450 --> 01:24:42.770
it goes on the air, they had deleted it from those as well.
他们也从这些版本里把这部分删掉了。

1849
01:24:43.210 --> 01:24:43.770
Oh my gosh.
哦，天哪。

1850
01:24:43.770 --> 01:24:50.570
And then Jen said that all of the scripts, every single disc that was sent to NBC, they
然后珍说，所有的剧本，发给NBC的每一张光盘，他们

